---
/**
 * Anti-bot honeypot. A field no human can see or tab into, so anything that
 * arrives filled was filled by a script — workspace drops those submissions
 * (see the `_gotcha` check in leadWebhookController).
 *
 * It is a component rather than a line copied into each form because a honeypot
 * that drifts between placements silently stops matching what the server checks.
 *
 * `hidden` the attribute, not a class: it survives any stylesheet failing to load,
 * which is exactly the state a scraper renders in.
 */
---

<input
  type="text"
  name="_gotcha"
  hidden
  tabindex="-1"
  autocomplete="off"
  aria-hidden="true"
/>
